    "breadcrumb": "Go Kure — Launcher \u003e Getting Started",
    "content": "Examples The examples/ directory contains runnable OAM Applications and cluster profiles. Build any of them with:\nkurel build examples/01-webservice-minimal.yaml \\ --profile examples/cluster-profiles/minimal.yaml Application examples Example Shows 01-webservice-minimal / 02-…-with-expose / 03-…-with-tls / 04-…-full webservice from minimal to full (expose, TLS, probes, volumes) 05-worker-minimal / 06-worker-with-traits background workers 07-cronjob-minimal / 08-cronjob-full scheduled jobs 09-postgresql-minimal / 10-postgresql-ha CloudNativePG databases 11-helm Helm chart via Flux 12-daemonset / 13-statefulset node daemons and stateful workloads 14-full-stack a multi-component application 15-passthrough-minimal emit an arbitrary object verbatim Cluster profiles \u0026 custom capabilities cluster-profiles/ — platform profiles (minimal, cert-manager + vault, gateway + AWS, …). custom-capability/ — extending kurel with a custom capability. See the Component Handlers, Trait Handlers and Policy Handlers references for the full set of types and their properties.",
